      delaySeconds: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  - guid: 2af61518-27b5-4daf-a9a7-4a1394ff9762
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: A woman passed me by on the street recently.
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: 985912f2-2f85-4535-8447-7f3ad8fe5cb2
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: She was holding steaming hot plate of noodles, reeking of chili, and I could have sworn I knew her.
      delaySeconds: 2.6
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: 047388e7-bdb7-4c71-9b33-8743c9a5cab9
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I got the urge to run up and give her a hug, but as I was going to say hi, I forgot her name, then her face.
      delaySeconds: 4.5
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: 7785f696-fda6-4590-af6a-42d8797a5fb8
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: She never was who I thought she was. I also don't even know who I thought she was in the first place.
      delaySeconds: 4.9
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
  - guid: 1cf145b2-2ffa-4c67-ab93-05d0350a30da
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: This synthetic mind will be the death of me...
      delaySeconds: 4.6
    editorPosition: {x: 1300, y: 0}
  - guid: ee4d9a82-3887-457b-b060-7951e201ec08
    kind: 4
    line:
      text: 
      delaySeconds: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 1560, y: 0}
